Oh, cool, a new CLL version!

However, I really *hate* the new formatting. The font is extremely tiny
and is not at all optimized for browser. In my browser at the standard
zoom, it looks like about 80% of horizontal space is just empty,
because the text makes an early line break.
Even if I zoom, the HTML seems to force a fixed page width, the rest is
just left empty.
IMO the full page width should be used for the text to make it more
browser-friendly.

The new formatting looks like it is only for the printed version, not
the browser version.

